WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.366
Continue with the description, responsibilities, qualifications, benefits,

00:00:06.416 --> 00:00:07.645
and search text.

00:00:07.695 --> 00:00:13.800
Close now stops new applications while leaving the vacancy visible as closed.

00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:15.719
You can reopen it later.

00:00:15.769 --> 00:00:18.597
Archive removes it from the website.

00:00:18.647 --> 00:00:22.674
Each action explains its effect before you confirm.
